  "implementation_instructions_for_ai": [
    "Build mobile-first HTML/CSS/React views from these four states.",
    "Use the provided background PNG files exclusively as decorative layers.",
    "Do not place Pokémon art, text, search elements or cards into the CSS background.",
    "Use data-driven reusable components: SearchBar, FilterChips, PokemonCard, BottomNav, DetailHero, TabBar, VariantCard and InfoSection.",
    "Provide real transparent-character assets from a properly licensed Pokemon source separately; none are included here.",
    "All measurements are visual estimates from a composite screenshot; verify on target device.",
    "Do not fabricate data for other Pokémon or unsupported tabs; show placeholders until sourced."
  ]
